WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.200
Build and share an exhibition. At least three items in your Vault. About 3 minutes.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:15.600
Create First Exhibition. Open Exhibitions and choose Create First Exhibition.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:26.100
Title and description. Give it a title and a short description.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:36.600
Choose who can see it. Start with Private while you build. Then choose Create Exhibition.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:47.100
Your exhibition page. Your exhibition is created, private and ready to fill.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:57.600
Choose items. Choose Edit/Add. Your Vault items appear to pick from.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:08.100
Add them. Tick the items you want, then choose Add to Exhibit.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:18.600
Review and save. Your items sit on the shelf with their total value. Choose Save.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:29.100
Preview as a visitor. Open the guest preview to see what visitors will see.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:39.600
Choose visibility. Choose Public Exhibit, then confirm Make public.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:50.100
Share it. The exhibition is Public. Use Copy Link or the share buttons.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:57.000
Your exhibition is public and ready to share. Next: import more of your collection with a spreadsheet.
